@startuml
title v1.0 稷下知识博客系统 - 时序图集合

' ============================================
' 时序图 1：用户注册与登录
' ============================================
newpage 用户注册与登录流程

actor "用户" as User
participant "Browser\n(HTML表单)" as Browser
participant "auth_bp\n/auth/*" as AuthRoute
participant "AuthService" as AuthSvc
participant "User\n(Model)" as UserModel
database "SQLite" as DB

== 注册 ==

User -> Browser : 访问 /register
Browser -> AuthRoute : GET /register
AuthRoute --> Browser : register.html 表单
User -> Browser : 填写用户名/邮箱/密码
Browser -> AuthRoute : POST /register
AuthRoute -> AuthSvc : register(username, email, password)
AuthSvc -> UserModel : 检查 username/email 唯一性
UserModel -> DB : SELECT
DB --> UserModel : 查询结果
AuthSvc -> UserModel : User(password_hash=...)
UserModel -> DB : INSERT
DB --> UserModel : OK
AuthSvc --> AuthRoute : User 对象
AuthRoute -> AuthRoute : login_user(user)
AuthRoute --> Browser : 302 → 个人中心

== 登录 ==

User -> Browser : 访问 /login
Browser -> AuthRoute : GET /login
AuthRoute --> Browser : login.html 表单
User -> Browser : 填写用户名/邮箱+密码
Browser -> AuthRoute : POST /login
AuthRoute -> AuthSvc : authenticate(login_id, password)
AuthSvc -> UserModel : 按 username/email 查询
UserModel -> DB : SELECT
DB --> UserModel : User 记录
AuthSvc -> UserModel : check_password(password)
UserModel --> AuthSvc : True/False
AuthSvc --> AuthRoute : User 或 None
AuthRoute -> AuthRoute : login_user(user)
alt 管理员登录管理后台
  AuthRoute --> Browser : 302 → /admin/dashboard
else 普通用户
  AuthRoute --> Browser : 302 → /user/center
end

' ============================================
' 时序图 2：文章发布流程
' ============================================
newpage 文章发布流程

actor "作者" as Writer
participant "Browser\n(写作页)" as WritePage
participant "article_bp\n/article/*" as ArticleRoute
participant "ArticleService" as ArtSvc
participant "Article\n(Model)" as ArtModel
participant "Tag\n(Model)" as TagModel
database "SQLite" as DB2

Writer -> WritePage : 访问 /write
WritePage -> ArticleRoute : GET /write
ArticleRoute --> WritePage : write.html (含分类/标签/专栏选择)
Writer -> WritePage : 填写标题/正文/摘要\n选择分类/标签/专栏\n点击发布
WritePage -> ArticleRoute : POST /write
ArticleRoute -> ArtSvc : validate(form, user)
ArtSvc --> ArticleRoute : 校验结果 (errors or OK)
alt 校验失败
  ArticleRoute --> WritePage : 返回表单错误信息
else 校验通过
  ArticleRoute -> ArtSvc : create_or_update(form, user, article=None)
  ArtSvc -> ArtModel : 生成 slug
  ArtSvc -> ArtModel : Article(title, content, ...)
  ArtModel -> DB2 : INSERT INTO articles
  DB2 --> ArtModel : article.id
  loop 每个选中的标签
    ArtSvc -> TagModel : create_or_get(name)
    TagModel -> DB2 : INSERT OR IGNORE
    ArtSvc -> DB2 : INSERT INTO article_tags
  end
  ArtSvc --> ArticleRoute : Article 对象
  alt status = published
    ArticleRoute --> WritePage : 302 → /article/<slug>
  else status = draft
    ArticleRoute --> WritePage : 302 → /write?edit=<id>
  end
end

' ============================================
' 时序图 3：AI 智能搜索
' ============================================
newpage AI 智能搜索流程

actor "用户" as Searcher
participant "Browser\n(搜索页)" as SearchPage
participant "ai_bp\n/ai/search" as AiRoute
participant "AIService" as AiSvc
participant "AI API\n(OpenAI 兼容)" as AIAPI
participant "ArticleService" as ArtSvc2
participant "AiLog\n(Model)" as AiLogModel
database "SQLite" as DB3

Searcher -> SearchPage : 输入搜索词
SearchPage -> SearchPage : fetch("/ai/search", {q: "..."})
SearchPage -> AiRoute : POST /ai/search (JSON)
AiRoute -> AiSvc : smart_search(query)

== 阶段1: 意图理解与关键词扩展 ==
AiSvc -> AIAPI : POST Chat Completions\n(提示词: 意图理解+关键词扩展)
alt API 调用成功
  AIAPI --> AiSvc : {意图, 扩展关键词[]}
else API 未配置或失败
  AIAPI --> AiSvc : 错误/降级信号
  AiSvc -> AiSvc : 降级: 使用原始关键词
end

== 阶段2: SQL 多关键词检索 ==
AiSvc -> ArtSvc2 : search_published(keywords)
ArtSvc2 -> DB3 : SELECT ... WHERE title/content/summary LIKE ...
DB3 --> ArtSvc2 : 候选文章列表
ArtSvc2 --> AiSvc : 候选文章

== 阶段3: AI 重排序 ==
AiSvc -> AIAPI : POST Chat Completions\n(候选文章 + 重排提示词)
alt 重排成功
  AIAPI --> AiSvc : {排序结果, 推荐理由[]}
else 重排失败
  AiSvc -> AiSvc : 降级: 返回 SQL 候选结果
end

== 阶段4: 记录日志并返回 ==
AiSvc -> AiLogModel : AiLog(scene="ai_search", ...)
AiLogModel -> DB3 : INSERT INTO ai_logs
AiSvc --> AiRoute : {pipeline[], results[]}
AiRoute --> SearchPage : JSON 响应
SearchPage -> SearchPage : renderAiSearchResults()\n渲染流水线步骤 + 结果卡片

' ============================================
' 时序图 4：评论审核流程
' ============================================
newpage 评论提交与审核流程

actor "读者" as Reader
actor "管理员" as Admin
participant "Browser" as Browser2
participant "comment_bp\n/comment/*" as CommentRoute
participant "admin_bp\n/admin/*" as AdminRoute
participant "CommentService" as CommentSvc
participant "Comment\n(Model)" as CommentModel
database "SQLite" as DB4

== 读者提交评论 ==

Reader -> Browser2 : 在文章页填写评论
Browser2 -> CommentRoute : POST /comment/<article_id>
CommentRoute -> CommentRoute : @login_required 检查
CommentRoute -> CommentSvc : create(form, article, user)
CommentSvc -> CommentModel : Comment(status="pending", ...)
CommentModel -> DB4 : INSERT INTO comments
CommentSvc --> CommentRoute : Comment 对象
CommentRoute --> Browser2 : 提示"等待审核"

== 管理员审核 ==

Admin -> Browser2 : 访问 /admin/comments
Browser2 -> AdminRoute : GET /admin/comments
AdminRoute -> CommentModel : 查询 pending/hidden 评论
CommentModel -> DB4 : SELECT
DB4 --> CommentModel : 评论列表
AdminRoute --> Browser2 : admin/comments.html

alt 审核通过
  Admin -> Browser2 : 点击"通过"
  Browser2 -> AdminRoute : POST /admin/comment/<id>/approve
  AdminRoute -> CommentSvc : approve(comment)
  CommentSvc -> CommentModel : status = "approved"
  CommentModel -> DB4 : UPDATE comments
  CommentSvc --> AdminRoute : OK
  AdminRoute --> Browser2 : 刷新列表
  note right: 评论在文章页公开展示
else 隐藏
  Admin -> Browser2 : 点击"隐藏"
  Browser2 -> AdminRoute : POST /admin/comment/<id>/hide
  AdminRoute -> CommentSvc : hide(comment)
  CommentSvc -> CommentModel : status = "hidden"
  CommentModel -> DB4 : UPDATE
  note right: 评论对读者不可见但保留记录
else 删除
  Admin -> Browser2 : 点击"删除"
  Browser2 -> AdminRoute : POST /admin/comment/<id>/delete
  AdminRoute -> CommentSvc : delete(comment)
  CommentSvc -> DB4 : DELETE FROM comments
  note right: 物理删除评论记录
end

' ============================================
' 时序图 5：AI 辅助写作
' ============================================
newpage AI 辅助写作流程

actor "作者" as Writer2
participant "Browser\n(写作页)" as WritePage2
participant "ai_bp\n/ai/*" as AiRoute2
participant "AIService" as AiSvc2
participant "AI API\n(OpenAI 兼容)" as AIAPI2
participant "AiLog" as AiLogModel2
database "SQLite" as DB5

Writer2 -> WritePage2 : 在写作页选择 AI 功能
note over WritePage2 : 摘要/标签/润色/问答/大纲/标题

alt 搜资料 (v1.0)
  Writer2 -> WritePage2 : 点击"AI 搜资料"
  WritePage2 -> AiRoute2 : POST /ai/research
  AiRoute2 -> AiSvc2 : research(query)

else 生成大纲 (v1.0)
  Writer2 -> WritePage2 : 点击"AI 大纲"
  WritePage2 -> AiRoute2 : POST /ai/outline
  AiRoute2 -> AiSvc2 : generate_outline(topic)

else 内容润色 (v1.0)
  Writer2 -> WritePage2 : 选中文本 + 润色指令
  WritePage2 -> AiRoute2 : POST /ai/polish
  AiRoute2 -> AiSvc2 : polish(content, instruction)

else 搜索摘要 (v1.0)
  Writer2 -> WritePage2 : 点击"AI 搜索摘要"
  WritePage2 -> AiRoute2 : POST /ai/search-summary
  AiRoute2 -> AiSvc2 : search_summary(article)

else AI 对话 (v1.0)
  Writer2 -> WritePage2 : 输入对话消息
  WritePage2 -> AiRoute2 : POST /ai/chat
  AiRoute2 -> AiSvc2 : chat(article, message)
end

AiSvc2 -> AiSvc2 : check_config()
alt API Key 已配置
  AiSvc2 -> AIAPI2 : POST Chat Completions
  alt 调用成功
    AIAPI2 --> AiSvc2 : AI 返回结果
    AiSvc2 -> AiLogModel2 : AiLog(is_adopted=False)\n记录调用日志
    AiLogModel2 -> DB5 : INSERT
    AiSvc2 --> AiRoute2 : AI 结果
  else 调用失败
    AIAPI2 --> AiSvc2 : 错误
    AiSvc2 -> AiLogModel2 : 记录错误日志
    AiSvc2 --> AiRoute2 : 错误信息
  end
else API Key 未配置
  AiSvc2 --> AiRoute2 : "AI 接口未配置，请设置 API Key"
end
AiRoute2 --> WritePage2 : JSON 响应
WritePage2 -> WritePage2 : 展示 AI 结果到编辑器

' ============================================
' 时序图 6：AI 阅读助手 (v1.0 新增)
' ============================================
newpage AI 阅读助手流程 (v1.0)

actor "读者" as Reader2
participant "Browser\n(文章页)" as ArticlePage
participant "ai_bp\n/ai/reading" as AiReadingRoute
participant "AIService" as AiSvc3
participant "AI API\n(OpenAI 兼容)" as AIAPI3
participant "AiLog" as AiLogModel3
database "SQLite" as DB6

Reader2 -> ArticlePage : 阅读文章
ArticlePage -> ArticlePage : 展示 AI 阅读助手入口
Reader2 -> ArticlePage : 点击"AI 阅读助手"\n或输入问题
ArticlePage -> AiReadingRoute : POST /ai/reading\n{article_id, question}
AiReadingRoute -> AiReadingRoute : _get_accessible_article()\n验证文章可访问性
AiReadingRoute -> AiSvc3 : reading_assistant(article, question)

AiSvc3 -> AiSvc3 : check_config()
alt API Key 已配置
  AiSvc3 -> AIAPI3 : POST Chat Completions\n(文章内容 + 读者问题)
  alt 调用成功
    AIAPI3 --> AiSvc3 : AI 分析结果
    AiSvc3 -> AiLogModel3 : AiLog(scene="reading")\n记录调用日志
    AiLogModel3 -> DB6 : INSERT
    AiSvc3 --> AiReadingRoute : AI 阅读分析结果
  else 调用失败
    AiSvc3 -> AiLogModel3 : 记录错误日志
    AiSvc3 --> AiReadingRoute : 降级提示
  end
else API Key 未配置
  AiSvc3 --> AiReadingRoute : "AI 阅读助手未配置"
end
AiReadingRoute --> ArticlePage : JSON 响应
ArticlePage -> ArticlePage : 展示 AI 阅读分析

' ============================================
' 时序图 7：AI 内容审核 (v1.0 新增)
' ============================================
newpage AI 内容审核流程 (v1.0)

actor "管理员" as Admin2
participant "Browser\n(管理后台)" as AdminPage
participant "admin_bp / ai_bp" as AdminRoute2
participant "AIService" as AiSvc4
participant "AI API\n(OpenAI 兼容)" as AIAPI4
participant "Article\n(Model)" as ArtModel2
participant "AiLog" as AiLogModel4
database "SQLite" as DB7

== AI 质量检测 ==

Admin2 -> AdminPage : 访问文章管理
AdminPage -> AdminRoute2 : 触发 AI 质量检测
AdminRoute2 -> AiSvc4 : quality_check(article)
AiSvc4 -> AiSvc4 : check_config()

alt API Key 已配置
  AiSvc4 -> AIAPI4 : POST Chat Completions\n(文章内容 + 质量评估提示词)
  alt 调用成功
    AIAPI4 --> AiSvc4 : {score, report, suggestions}
    AiSvc4 -> ArtModel2 : 更新 ai_quality_score\nai_quality_report\nai_quality_suggestions\nai_quality_generated_at
    ArtModel2 -> DB7 : UPDATE articles
    AiSvc4 -> AiLogModel4 : AiLog(scene="quality_check")
    AiLogModel4 -> DB7 : INSERT
    AiSvc4 --> AdminRoute2 : 质量报告
  else 调用失败
    AiSvc4 --> AdminRoute2 : 降级提示
  end
else API Key 未配置
  AiSvc4 --> AdminRoute2 : "AI 审核未配置"
end
AdminRoute2 --> AdminPage : 展示 AI 质量评分/报告/建议

== AI 内容审核 ==

Admin2 -> AdminPage : 触发 AI 内容审核
AdminPage -> AdminRoute2 : POST /ai 审核
AdminRoute2 -> AiSvc4 : 调用审核逻辑
AiSvc4 -> AIAPI4 : POST Chat Completions\n(文章内容 + 合规审核提示词)
alt 审核通过
  AIAPI4 --> AiSvc4 : review_status=passed
  AiSvc4 -> ArtModel2 : ai_review_status="passed"\nai_reviewed_at=now()
else 疑似违规
  AIAPI4 --> AiSvc4 : review_status=suspected + reason
  AiSvc4 -> ArtModel2 : ai_review_status="suspected"\nai_review_reason=reason
end
ArtModel2 -> DB7 : UPDATE articles
AiSvc4 --> AdminRoute2 : 审核结果
AdminRoute2 --> AdminPage : 展示审核状态

note bottom
  v1.0 课程交付阶段。所有时序图基于当前代码实现。
  新增 v1.0 序列：AI 阅读助手、AI 内容审核。
  AI API 调用需配置 API Key 后验证真实远程调用。
  ADR-002：方案 B，保留 Flask + Jinja2 + SQLAlchemy + SQLite 技术栈。
end note
@enduml
